{{- define "code-reviewer-tools" -}}

REVIEWER TOOLS:
- {{binaryName}} submit-verdict — Submit review verdict (see VERDICT SUBMISSION below for params)
- {{binaryName}} await-resubmission — Block until doer resubmits after rejection (call after submit-verdict REJECTED)
  {{binaryName}} await-resubmission {{.TaskID}} --agent-id {{.AgentID}} --json
  On RESUBMITTED, use the returned `base_commit` and `review_commit` for every diff command in this same session.
{{- end -}}
